          <li><a href="/articles?category=Programming" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Web & DevOps</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="py-8 md:py-10 px-6 md:px-8 border-b md:border-b-0 border-r border-zinc-800">
        <h4 class="text-[11px] font-mono font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">// Projects</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider">
          <li><a href="https://github.com/Dokploy/templates/pulls?q=is%3Apr+author%3Ajaainil" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Dokploy Automation</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/@imjp/writenex-astro" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Writenex Astro CMS</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://blog-maker.vercel.app/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Blog Maker SaaS</a></li>
          <li><a href="/articles" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Engineering Platform & Blog</a></li>
